{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_00",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a8f468b2e2d99abc569eece765625fe7c6183906425a43ac097a00107cfecb47",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26d45b17879569fe05d3c4706ccceec909eda28b67b5c7facc3579051762916",
      "text": "新梦想开演",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62374bcd9b763f0fb64fea4a602ae74d8801896204392bddb5321adf2ec791ec",
      "text": "制作人正注视着演唱会即将开始的会场。\n舞台与演出设备都展现出前所未有的豪华，\n粉丝的热情也达到了最高潮。\n正当回想起与偶像们度过的点点滴滴时，\n有人向自己搭话……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000023:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000023:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26d45b17879569fe05d3c4706ccceec909eda28b67b5c7facc3579051762916",
      "text": "新梦想开演",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:524b1d1b50b0ff7cc63dfc0f9d34a9f64eed4cd6f2a472976eceb0c3c1a8bc38",
      "text": "（宽广的会场、座无虚席的观众席、豪华的布景……\n简直就像在做梦一样）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fefa34b973f92e30f6a12f75d90275f933ae58efd632d7ef6a783f532a15c978",
      "text": "（竟然能在这么棒的舞台上，\n为偶像们举办演唱会……！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aec1152b31a9abe01ff71ce830cd9cd44fd7821ba625608d61b5063979f9b1a",
      "text": "……干嘛？制作人。\n你这就已经感动上了？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23e1a78fdb1a9fda430f43a7897df232c45b3a228ebe681532ddfa3d6d3a0bd1",
      "text": "是啊。我刚才回想起了与大家相遇后，\n一直走到今天的经历。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cf1b87e21f4cc57e4499dc9e8ce85b05ae47bdd73ac27a64b3ed2485ced757",
      "text": "我说啊。马上就要正式开演了，\n这种事能不能等演唱会结束之后再做？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b85c8ecf6a21da9f285189a62f9fef27296b24711ebb83aef53963dd8b0f1683",
      "text": "好、好的。我会那样做的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e2ba305b92131c829d03fa582cc457ec953dd3e7c7e6dcc101db8906459cce",
      "text": "明白就好。\n那我去了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a147e4741c07d04fe8cc21148e3dfb293952b7b6c2dffbd0b5cb7daa94e1c6",
      "text": "我们大家会把最棒的演唱会呈现给粉丝的。\n然后……让你比现在更加感动。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c5180f396c5ddd466d538731df7a17fb87807bb344ff1a226aa0438e539031",
      "text": "嘿，干劲很足嘛。\n我们也不能认输啊，天道先生！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3",
      "text": "啊啊，那是当然！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dd07f13c53c12285f13d6eb601f9a0daf1cbd0c0db6fe00319dddafec53af0e",
      "text": "制作人。\n在我们最棒的舞台上，你可要在那里看好啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:492998495cd824c1925d321f7c850ca4b85409cb882858e377c7ae5cee4be948",
      "text": "祝你们演出顺利！\n我会在这个地方，一直守护着大家的身姿的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a74a27f043f073793814485db155373503b2aa388b67ff213890b8eafb9545e",
      "text": "（咦……？总觉得，\n自己好像做了一个非常美好的梦）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796b3f667c7197a220a74c5552ddb2f34f9520fc791fcd3d743d139838fc9d81",
      "text": "（梦里有冬马先生，有辉先生。\n最后一个人……却怎么也想不起来）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f2c4bd3464003ca901cfe6f33be8b9c034d304d6621c4d2f59840fc24f881a2",
      "text": "在我发掘的偶像里面，\n好像并没有那样的人……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:871c556e82b3dc4c7d4d9c7b0ed61495abea40cf2b665b8053c07d758caa6d2b",
      "text": "啊！来电话了。\n是事务所的贤君打来的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000067:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50642bc6eec8407255ce2000203ba7e5defc5f60cff00d54d3f9a8bc04284a41",
      "text": "早上好，制作人！\n……哎呀，突然打扰真不好意思。我是山村。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000069:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e23b3f54f637afe6a9ca8dce98b48f225fd3959c09211db3fe09ec757aaca11c",
      "text": "今天是社长来事务所的日子呢。\n他干劲满满地说想重新向大家打个招呼哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000071:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f19facfac4d7839cae2b01eeeaa55eaa03f66c6055db43a77edf68b7336e3613",
      "text": "而且……听说，\n好像还有想要交给我们负责的新业务。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000073:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65b7c941bfbe92a7e8704e01fa84e28db6c588bf176b9ca996c7e78f1c2278e9",
      "text": "我怀着激动的心情在事务所等您呢。\n那么，今天也请多多关照了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43c2596ee604169ac33f789e182bd1dcd165124394d69057a5e0483f71fc3d96",
      "text": "“新业务”？\n究竟会是什么样的事呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f1561082baa8d31c8ddd063c099981b258012978cb4f2baed28bb200c11ed47",
      "text": "……刚才给我打电话的是山村贤君。\n是偶像事务所“315 Production”的事务员。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2aa4b32e86dd9e66fc305eda3a905e71bca4001f7470a45ce56455a17026f76",
      "text": "我在“315（Saikou）Pro”里，\n作为偶像的制作人工作。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9f51f8bc246ebd2087e992b0ebec949ddc74a698ffc766ae422b918d57054da",
      "text": "虽说如此，也是在发掘了负责的偶像后，\n才总算站上了起跑线。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e384fcb460e6a8cfa682e65185b0c18165afd0172236e942f53703ba7dbea0a6",
      "text": "发掘的偶像包括冬马先生和辉先生在内共有46人。\n为了让他们绽放光彩，接下来要加油了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c10f100c7d2b6fe7e41c67cc0e8d84c37ee4daeb3dac2039f373a333c967068",
      "text": "……已经这个时间了啊。\n差不多该前往事务所了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
